ections for **Jackson Merrill** remain robust thanks to a 14% park advantage, any unexpected defensive shifts or rest days will force us to pivot toward depth pieces like **Miguel Vargas** or **Luis Lara**. Despite a solid analytical profile, **Miguel Vargas** remains on the bench today primarily because his matchup against Messick offers lower run-creation leverage compared to our current infield starters. We will proceed with the active roster as slated, keeping a close eye on weather developments that could influence the scores for our key bats in the later games.",
